/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   YOUR SPACE — Vantary edition

   Pixel-strict translation of the 40 Vantary/RON reference frames into the
   trader's command surface. Every numeral, hairline, dashed grid, scrubber,
   wireframe glyph, frosted overlay, severity wash and chromatic-aberration
   bloom is mapped from a specific reference image.

   Reference map (image -> module here):
     #11 amber capsule "122,580"        -> Live Equity Volume tooltip pill
     #2  paired bars Jan-Jul             -> Live Equity Volume paired-day bars
     #3  "78.3%" waveform + target line  -> Trading Accuracy waveform card
     #4  macro chart with peak dots      -> Accuracy peak dots + dashed ladder
     #14 frosted "87% Passenger Load"    -> Discipline Load frosted card
     #1  "Bus 6023" tracking tile        -> Account asset card archetype
     #17 same with scrubber rail         -> Account scrubber Mon -> Sun
     #8  Schedule Offset table           -> Avg R:R setup x session matrix
     #6  Warning / Capacity Issues       -> Strategy Health warning sheet
     #16 chip pills + bell + avatar      -> Vantary header utility row
     #18 "Save this design" headline     -> Hero eyebrow + caption pair

   Strict rules (vantary-theme.ts):
     - 3 colours + 2 neutrals (amber is the ONLY chromatic)
     - 1px hairlines on every stroke
     - Dashed horizontal grid only, y-axis floats right
     - Magnitude / precision two-weight numerics
     - Glass cards with backdrop-blur 24px and 24-28px radius
     - Greens / reds appear ONLY as status dots (online check, bell badge)
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

